# Kamehameha charge: hold B. Generated by tools/gen_kame.py. Lua counts the charge (lua/goku.lua: 15 frames a step,
# 60 = full, no auto-fire); the ki ball at the hands is fx P_TrailGokuXKameCharge (XV2's Kmh_Crg/CrgON/tsubu, tools/xv2_fx.py).
# XV2 BAC entry 0: the "ka-me-ha-me" voice (VOX cue 0) and the charge SE (SE cue 0) both start at frame 0 (tools/xv2_audio.py). No damaging hitbox.
PUT ANIM_RATE 1.0
clear_hitboxes
sfx behavior=1 sfx_id=200121 volume=127 panning=64
sfx behavior=1 sfx_id=200124 volume=127 panning=64
wait_until 80
